nz M's involvement in both clinical research and the development of nutritional guidelines in medical practice.GOMEZ P:Gomez P is an author who contributed to research on oral glutamine supplements in hematopoietic transplant patients.VALERO MA:Valero MA is a researcher who studied the effects of oral glutamine supplements in hematopoietic transplant patients.LA HUERTA JJ:La Huerta JJ is a researcher who studied the impact of oral glutamine supplements in hematopoietic transplant patients.MARCUS R:Marcus R is a researcher involved in the pilot study of oral glutamine supplementation in bone marrow transplant patients.MASSZI T:Masszi T is a researcher who studied the benefits of glutamine supplementation in total parenteral nutrition for ABMT patients.BAITAI A:Batai A is an author involved in the study of glutamine supplementation in total parenteral nutrition for ABMT patients.REMENYL P:Remenyl P is a researcher who contributed to the study of glutamine supplementation in ABMT patients.RETI M:Reti M is an author who studied the effects of glutamine supplementation in ABMT patients.KRIVAN G:Krivan G is a researcher involved in the study of glutamine supplementation in ABMT patients.PICARDI M:Picardi M is an author who studied the effects of early administration of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplanted patients.SELLERI C:Selleri C is a researcher who contributed to the study of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplant patients.VOLPICELLI M:Volpicelli M is an author involved in the study of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplant patients.ROTOLI B:Rotoli B is a researcher who studied the effects of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplant patients.PICCIRILLO N:N. Piccirillo is a researcher and author who specializes in studies related to parenteral nutrition and stem cell transplantation. He has conducted research on glutamine-enriched parenteral nutrition specifically following a