EZ:Dr. Isabel Gonz√°lez-Posada G√≥mez is a pediatric specialist who focuses on pediatrics and child care. She works at the Centro de Salud de Ra√≠ces in Salinas, Asturias, where she provides care and expertise in her field.CONCEPCI√ìN GUINDEL JIM√âNEZ:Concepci√≥n Guindel Jim√©nez is a specialist pharmacist in Hospital Pharmacy at the Complejo Asistencial in Le√≥n. Additionally, Dr. Guindel Jim√©nez is recognized as a specialist in nutrition and dietetics, showcasing her expertise in both pharmaceutical care and nutritional guidance.CENTRO DE SALUD DE RA:The Centro de Salud de Ra is a health center in Asturias, focusing on pediatric care.AUTLOGOUS STEM CELL TRANSPLANTATION:Autologous stem cell transplantation is a procedure where a patient's own stem cells are collected, stored, and then infused back after intensive treatment.HAEMATOLOGICAL MALIGNANCIES:Hematological malignancies are cancers that affect blood, bone marrow, and lymph nodes, including leukemia, lymphoma, and myeloma.CENTRO DE SALUD DE RA√çCES:The Centro de Salud de Ra√≠ces is a health center located in Salinas, Asturias, focusing on pediatric care.SALINAS:(N␀␀␀␀␀␀™N␀␀␀␀␀␀'O␀␀␀␀␀␀ÑO␀␀␀␀␀␀ÏO␀␀␀␀␀␀WP␀␀␀␀␀␀˛P␀␀␀␀␀␀ñQ␀␀␀␀␀␀OR␀␀␀␀␀␀≤U␀␀␀␀␀␀1V␀␀␀␀␀␀—V␀␀␀␀␀␀^W␀␀␀␀␀␀ÊW␀␀␀␀␀␀ôX␀␀␀␀␀␀iY␀␀␀␀␀␀˙Y␀␀␀␀␀␀≠Z␀␀␀␀␀␀I[␀␀␀␀␀␀[␀␀␀␀␀␀ï\␀␀␀␀␀␀3]␀␀␀␀␀␀ƒ^␀␀␀␀␀␀8_␀␀␀␀␀␀Ω_␀␀␀␀␀␀:`␀␀␀␀␀␀¥`␀␀␀␀␀␀,a␀␀␀␀␀␀†a␀␀␀␀␀␀b␀␀␀␀␀␀~b␀␀␀␀␀␀Ób␀␀␀␀␀␀Zc␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿc␀␀␀␀␀␀Nd␀␀␀␀␀␀¿d␀␀␀␀␀␀3e␀␀␀␀␀␀•e␀␀␀␀␀␀f␀␀␀␀␀␀òf␀␀␀␀␀␀$g␀␀␀␀␀␀´g␀␀␀␀␀␀h␀␀␀␀␀␀(h␀␀␀␀␀␀·h␀␀␀␀␀␀}i␀␀␀␀␀␀j␀␀␀␀␀␀Öj␀␀␀␀␀␀˚j␀␀␀␀␀␀jk␀␀␀␀␀␀¸k␀␀␀␀␀␀hl␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿl␀␀␀␀␀␀:m␀␀␀␀␀␀ím␀␀␀␀␀␀
