cher involved in studies on naso-jejunal feeding in transplant patients."}{"title": "GOLDMAN JM:"}{"title": "AUTOLOGOUS HEMATOPOIETIC STEM CELL TRANSPLANTATION:Autologous hematopoietic stem cell transplantation is a procedure where a patient's own stem cells are used to replace damaged or destroyed bone marrow."}{"title": "ALLOGENIC STEM CELL TRANSPLANTATION:Allogenic stem cell transplantation involves the transfer of stem cells from a donor to a recipient, often used to treat blood cancers."}{"title": "WATKINS R:Watkins R is an author who contributed to studies on nutritional support for bone marrow transplant patients."}{"title": "CAMPBELL M:Campbell M is an author who has researched parenteral nutrition in the context of bone marrow transplantation."}{"title": "BURNETT K:Burnett K is an author involved in studies regarding nutritional interventions for bone marrow transplant recipients."}{"title": "SZLUGA DJ:Szluga DJ is an author who conducted a clinical trial comparing total parenteral nutrition to enteral feeding for bone marrow transplant patients."}{"title": "STUART RK:Stuart RK is an author who has researched nutritional support for patients undergoing bone marrow transplantation."}{"title": "HOPMAN GD:Hopman GD is an author who studied tube feeding and its effects on bone marrow transplantation outcomes."}{"title": "PENA EG:Pena EG is an author involved in research on nutritional support for bone marrow transplant patients."}{"title": "VAN WEEL MH:Van Weel MH is an author who contributed to studies on nutritional interventions in bone marrow transplantation."}{"title": "VOSSEN JM:Vossen JM is an author who has researched the impact of tube feeding on bone marrow transplant recipients."}{"title": "MEARIN ML:Mearin ML is an author involved in studies related to nutritional support in bone marrow transplantation."}{"title": "WEISDORF S:Weisdorf S is an author who has researched total parenteral nutrition in the context of bone marrow transplantation."}{"title