guidelines in medical practice."}{"title": "GOMEZ P:Gomez P is an author who contributed to research on oral glutamine supplements in hematopoietic transplant patients."}{"title": "VALERO MA:Valero MA is a researcher who studied the effects of oral glutamine supplements in hematopoietic transplant patients."}{"title": "LA HUERTA JJ:La Huerta JJ is a researcher who studied the impact of oral glutamine supplements in hematopoietic transplant patients."}{"title": "MARCUS R:Marcus R is a researcher involved in the pilot study of oral glutamine supplementation in bone marrow transplant patients."}{"title": "MASSZI T:Masszi T is a researcher who studied the benefits of glutamine supplementation in total parenteral nutrition for ABMT patients."}{"title": "BAITAI A:Batai A is an author involved in the study of glutamine supplementation in total parenteral nutrition for ABMT patients."}{"title": "REMENYL P:Remenyl P is a researcher who contributed to the study of glutamine supplementation in ABMT patients."}{"title": "RETI M:Reti M is an author who studied the effects of glutamine supplementation in ABMT patients."}{"title": "KRIVAN G:Krivan G is a researcher involved in the study of glutamine supplementation in ABMT patients."}{"title": "PICARDI M:Picardi M is an author who studied the effects of early administration of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplanted patients."}{"title": "SELLERI C:Selleri C is a researcher who contributed to the study of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplant patients."}{"title": "VOLPICELLI M:Volpicelli M is an author involved in the study of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplant patients."}{"title": "ROTOLI B:Rotoli B is a researcher who studied the effects of high-dose oral glutamine in allogeneic bone marrow transplant patients."}{"title": "PICCIRILLO N:N. Piccirillo is a researcher and author who specializes in studies related to parenteral nutrition and stem cell transplantation. He has conducted research on glutamine-enriched parenteral nutrition specifically following autologous peripheral blood stem cell transplantation, contributing valuable insights to the field."}{"title": "DE MATTEIS S:De Matteis S is a researcher actively engaged in the study of glutamine-enriched parenteral nutrition, particularly in the context of autologous peripheral blood stem cell transplantation. S. De Matteis contributes to various studies focused on this specialized area of nutrition, highlighting the importance of glutamine in enhancing patient outcomes following stem cell procedures."}{"title": "LAURENTI L:L. Laurenti is a researcher focused on hematological studies and nutrition."}{"title": "CHIUSOLO P:P. Chiusolo is a researcher involved in studies on immune reconstitution after stem cell transplantation."}{"title": "SORA F:F. Sora is a researcher studying the effects of nutrition in clinical settings."}{"title": "PITTIRUTI M:M. Pittiruti is a researcher examining the role of glutamine in parenteral nutrition."}{"title": "PYTLIK R:R. Pytlik is a researcher who has conducted studies on parenteral glutamine and its effects on lymphocyte restoration."}{"title": "GREGORA E:E. Gregora is a researcher involved in studies on chemotherapy and hematopoietic cell transplantation."}{"title": "BENES P:P. Benes is a researcher studying the effects of nutritional supplementation in transplant patients."}{"title": "KOZAK T:T. Kozak is a researcher contributing to studies on parenteral nutrition."}{"title": "YOUNG LS:L.S. Young is a researcher studying the effects of glutamine supplementation on patients."}{"title": "CEFERINO MART\u00cdNEZ FAEDO:Ceferino Mart\u00ednez Faedo is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at the Hospital Universitario Central de Asturias in Oviedo, Asturias. He is specifically associated with the Nutrition Section of the hospital, where he applies his expertise in both fields to provide comprehensive care to his patients."}{"title": "JESSICA ARES BLANCO:Dr. Jessica Ares Blanco is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently working in the Nutrition Section at the University Hospital Central of Asturias, located in Oviedo, Asturias."}{"title": "ISABEL GONZ\u00c1LEZ-POSADA G\u00d3MEZ:Dr. Isabel Gonz\u00e1lez-Posada G\u00f3mez is a pediatric specialist who focuses on pediatrics and child care. She works at the Centro de Salud de Ra\u00edces in Salinas, Asturias, where she provides care and expertise in her field."}{"title": "CONCEPCI\u00d3N GUINDEL JIM\u00c9NEZ:Concepci\u00f3n Guindel Jim\u00e9nez is a specialist pharmacist in Hospital Pharmacy at the Complejo Asistencial in Le\u00f3n. Additionally, Dr. Guindel Jim\u00e9nez is recognized as a specialist in nutrition and dietetics, showcasing her expertise in both pharmaceutical care and nutritional guidance."}{"title": "CENTRO DE SALUD DE RA:The Centro de Salud de Ra is a health center in Asturias, focusing on pediatric care."}{"title": "AUTLOGOUS STEM CELL TRANSPLANTATION:Autologous stem cell transplantation is a procedure where a patient's own stem cells are collected, stored, and then infused back after intensive treatment."}{"title": "HAEMATOLOGICAL MALIGNANCIES:Hematological malignancies are cancers that affect blood, bone marrow, and lymph nodes, including leukemia, lymphoma, and myeloma."}{"title": "CENTRO DE SALUD DE RA\u00cdCES:The Centro de Salud de Ra\u00edces is a health center located in Salinas, Asturias, focusing on pediatric care."}{"title": "SALINAS:"}3^0␀␀␀␀␀¬^0␀␀␀␀␀L_0␀␀␀␀␀∂_0␀␀␀␀␀+`0␀␀␀␀␀£`0␀␀␀␀␀Wa0␀␀␀␀␀¸a0␀␀␀␀␀¬b0␀␀␀␀␀2f0␀␀␀␀␀æf0␀␀␀␀␀kg0␀␀␀␀␀h0␀␀␀␀␀öh0␀␀␀␀␀Zi0␀␀␀␀␀7j0␀␀␀␀␀’j0␀␀␀␀␀ïk0␀␀␀␀␀>l0␀␀␀␀␀Úl0␀␀␀␀␀§m0␀␀␀␀␀On0␀␀␀␀␀Ìo0␀␀␀␀␀np0␀␀␀␀␀␀q0␀␀␀␀␀äq0␀␀␀␀␀r0␀␀␀␀␀ñr0␀␀␀␀␀s0␀␀␀␀␀ís0␀␀␀␀␀t0␀␀␀␀␀åt0␀␀␀␀␀u0␀␀␀␀␀êu0␀␀␀␀␀v0␀␀␀␀␀ív0␀␀␀␀␀w0␀␀␀␀␀ëw0␀␀␀␀␀x0␀␀␀␀␀ûx0␀␀␀␀␀7y0␀␀␀␀␀Ày0␀␀␀␀␀Fz0␀␀␀␀␀bz0␀␀␀␀␀({0␀␀␀␀␀—{0␀␀␀␀␀f|0␀␀␀␀␀Û|0␀␀␀␀␀v}0␀␀␀␀␀Ú}0␀␀␀␀␀ë~0␀␀␀␀␀
